        "baseline": "import math\nimport time\n\n\ndef primes_up_to(limit):\n    is_prime = bytearray(b\"\\x01\") * (limit + 1)\n    is_prime[:2] = b\"\\x00\\x00\"\n    for candidate in range(2, math.isqrt(limit) + 1):\n        if is_prime[candidate]:\n            start = candidate * candidate\n            is_prime[start::candidate] = bytes((limit - start) // candidate + 1)\n    return is_prime.count(1)\n\n\nstarted = time.process_time_ns()\nresult = 0\nfor repetition in range(100):\n    result += primes_up_to(20000)\nprint(result)\nprint(time.process_time_ns() - started)\n",
        "candidate": "import math\nimport time\n\n\ndef primes_up_to(limit):\n    is_prime = bytearray(b\"\\x01\") * (limit + 1)\n    is_prime[:2] = b\"\\x00\\x00\"\n    is_prime[4::2] = bytes((limit - 4) // 2 + 1)\n    for candidate in range(3, math.isqrt(limit) + 1, 2):\n        if is_prime[candidate]:\n            start = candidate * candidate\n            is_prime[start::candidate] = bytes((limit - start) // candidate + 1)\n    return is_prime.count(1)\n\n\nstarted = time.process_time_ns()\nresult = 0\nfor repetition in range(100):\n    result += primes_up_to(20000)\nprint(result)\nprint(time.process_time_ns() - started)\n"
